{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1151795-just-for-fun-halloween-movie-inspired-plot-ideas","id":1151795,"title":"[Just-for-Fun] Halloween Movie Inspired Plot Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-21T17:27:54-07:00","id":1151795,"title":"[Just-for-Fun] Halloween Movie Inspired Plot Ideas","content":"It's that time of the year again. There are already a number of plot hooks for the various splats floating around on their sub-forums. Let's post a few more inspired by any topical movies.<br /> <br /> I've posted <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/874976-1001-beast-story-hooks?p=1151793#post1151793\">this</a> one inspired by the Nightmare Before Christmas. Any others?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T18:34:38-07:00","id":1151808,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://disney.wikia.com/wiki/Halloweentown_II%3A_Kalabar&#39;s_Revenge\" target=\"_blank\">*Evil grin*</a><br /> <br /> Something's gone wrong all across the area. People are calling into the police reporting that their loved ones, their children, have been transformed into their costumes. Werewolves are roaming the streets, vampires striking without mercy, people are casting spells, and there are pirates ransacking local homes and killing anyone who fights back. Stop whatever this is, and try to return the affected back to normal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T23:12:11-07:00","id":1151870,"title":"","content":"So... there's a Witch Convention happening in a local hotel. Apparently something about cookie sales. Kids are disappearing, oddly enough and the hotel seems to have an excessive rodent infestation. Your family has reserved a stay at the hotel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T09:39:00-07:00","id":1151957,"title":"","content":"3 insane Liches have just returned to life through the machinations of their long dormant spell. But the Sleepwalkers who triggered their return have stolen their Grimorie - and without it, the Liches cannot cast the Rote that will permanently restore them to life. The deadline is dawn. Which side will you aid?<br /> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0107120/?ref_=nv_sr_1\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">I've put a spell on you.</span></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T14:28:26-07:00","id":1152029,"title":"","content":"A growing storm of temporal anomalies draws the players' cabal, who realize that this is due to an Awakening Acanthus caught in a looping temporal bubble to try and find some way out of her murder at the end of her birthday. It's up to the players to avoid being trapped in it or causing a cascade failure of Paradox, as well as attempting to avoid the temptation of killing her themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T14:42:27-07:00","id":1152032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1151795-just-for-fun-halloween-movie-inspired-plot-ideas?p=1152029#post1152029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As well as attempting to avoid the temptation of killing her themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>That annoying a main character huh?<br /> <br /> A trio of killers has escaped from the sheriff's department and is running wild through the county, killing and kidnapping at will. They must be stopped, one way or another. Just make sure the sheriff doesn't lose his own mind in the process.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T17:19:42-07:00","id":1152336,"title":"","content":"You (or your Allies) have just moved into a nice house that just opened up on the market. Unfortunately, it is haunted by the ghosts of its prior inhabitants. Who've also contacted a powerful Geist to help drive off the &quot;Intruders&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T23:35:54-07:00","id":1153073,"title":"","content":"Mortal authorities have been looking into a string of recent murders in which the victims are brutalized as the result of being forced to play macabre games, often involving seemingly impossible machinery and great requests of willpower, and losing them. The local Hunter cells are quick to cry 'Slasher,' but further investigation reveals that the intent of these games is not to kill the victim, but to test them. Therefore, the moniker of Slasher doesn't quite fit...<br /> <br /> The local Consilium knows the true story, however. Months ago, a Moros approached the Consilium seeking acceptance into Mage society, and to prove his worthiness, he told the tale of his Awakening and the theories he has developed since. The Mystery Play that the Supernal guided him through was a nightmare of tragedy, seeing the death of his unborn son, the death of his marriage, and his own eventual death with the diagnosis of cancer. It culminated in the man attempting to take his life, but in the resulting car crash, his will to live and fight through the pain finally opened his eyes, and he carved his name on the Watchtower of the Lead Coin with the shard of metal he pulled through his chest. His theory is that creating such an ordeal could be a way in which to Awaken the worthy and unworthy, forcing them to unlock their potential in order to save their own lives if their will was strong enough. These were dismissed as mad and dangerous ravings, and the Moros disappeared.<br /> <br /> Now it seems this mage is putting his theories to the test, and the bodies are piling up from those who failed. The Guardians of the Veil are preparing to find him and end this, but rumors are staring to emerge... Rumors that his theory may have more than a grain of truth... And that his method has succeeded at least once.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4497-tellme_tellme","name":"TellMe_TellMe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4497_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T23:48:29-07:00","id":1153079,"title":"","content":"Impromptu zombie outbreak","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-26T00:25:37-07:00","id":1153084,"title":"","content":"With wise guidance of the Autumn Court Freehold successfully deflects massive annual all out attack by the Gentry. Now as the dust settles, they can start preparing to handover the control to Winter Court.<br /> Then worrisome rumors start to emerge from the Hedge. Lord of Harvest and Terror seems to be on the move, obsessed with aspect of human culture that has escaped him before. <br /> What are those weird celebrations you hold throughout the winter season? What's this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12082-weird","name":"Weird","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12082_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}